        "identifier": "PALOMAR-2026-10-18-000009 (jtraverso/jaeger-four-flow @ 623dd0d)",
        "note": "The same author's entry (Jaeger's 4-flow and 8-flow theorems and Seymour's 6-flow theorem). Two of its files are included byte-identically: the multigraph model `SixFlowLib/SixFlowMG.lean` (here `ThreeFlowLib/SixFlowMG.lean`) and Tutte's lifting theorem from nowhere-zero ℤ/k-flows to integer k-flows `SixFlowLib/SixFlowTutte.lean` (here `ThreeFlowLib/SixFlowTutte.lean`). The definition `ThreeFlowTheorem.IsNowhereZeroFlow` is the same as `JaegerFlow.IsNowhereZeroFlow` there. Everything else (Theorem 3.1 of Lovász–Thomassen–Wu–Zhang and the orientation-to-flow bridge) is new in this entry.",
